test "review: starttls buffer handoff is surfaced"
  lang python
  expect_review code.ProtocolStateReview
  code
  ```
  class SMTP:
      def connection_made(self, transport):
          seen_starttls = self._original_transport is not None
          if self.transport is not None and seen_starttls:
              self._reader._transport = transport
              self._writer._transport = transport
              self.transport = transport
              self.session.ssl = self._tls_protocol._extra
          else:
              super().connection_made(transport)
  ```

test "review: fixed starttls buffer handoff is clean"
  lang python
  reject_review code.ProtocolStateReview
  code
  ```
  class SMTP:
      def connection_made(self, transport):
          seen_starttls = self._original_transport is not None
          if self.transport is not None and seen_starttls:
              self._reader._transport = transport
              self._writer._transport = transport
              self.transport = transport
              self._reader._buffer.clear()
              self.session.ssl = self._tls_protocol._extra
          else:
              super().connection_made(transport)
  ```

